## 3. Who This Catalog Is For

This catalog is intended for qualified technology partners that want to expand their VMware Cloud Foundation and advanced infrastructure service capabilities without building or maintaining a full internal team of highly specialized consultants.

Klaud works with partners that have strong commercial relationships and access to customer opportunities, but require additional technical depth to design, deploy, upgrade, migrate, or stabilize complex private cloud environments.

This includes:

* VMware, Broadcom, cloud, and infrastructure partners
* Value-added resellers
* Systems integrators
* Managed service providers
* IT consulting companies
* Cloud and data centre service providers
* Technology companies pursuing private cloud, hybrid cloud, modernization, security, disaster recovery, automation, or Kubernetes-related projects

The services described in this catalog are designed for partner-led opportunities where Klaud provides specialist expertise behind the scenes, alongside the partner’s technical team, or as a named expert delivery partner when required.

Klaud’s role is to help partners increase their delivery capacity, reduce technical risk, and pursue more advanced VMware-related projects with confidence.

This catalog may be used by partners for:

* Opportunity qualification
* Pre-sales planning
* Technical solution design
* Professional services estimation
* Internal project costing
* Customer proposal preparation
* Delivery planning
* Specialist escalation and project rescue scenarios

All pricing included in this document is **partner net pricing** and is intended to give partners a clear commercial foundation for building their own customer-facing proposals. Partners are responsible for defining their final resale pricing, commercial margin, contract terms, and customer relationship model.

This catalog is **not intended to be used as an end-customer-facing price list**. Final scope, pricing, timelines, and delivery assumptions must be validated before any statement of work or project commitment is issued.
